    "updated_at": "2023-01-04T00:14:53Z",
    "body": "I thought [this stackoverflow answer](https://stackoverflow.com/a/43513257) might be relevant as I did not see the repeated characters when first time using starship with zsh from default WSL terminal.\r\n\r\nThe bug can be reproduced *after* I installed the nerd font to support fancy unicode character in the prompt.\r\n\r\nBut even after I uses `Consolas` font *without* fancy unicode support, I still can reproduce this issue in Windows Terminal.\r\nThe vscode terminal somehow uses a font  *without* fancy unicode support, with the same zsh setup, and does not have the issue.\r\n\r\n😵\r\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
