    "body": "This problem just popped up for me today after a fresh install of Ubuntu. Hard to narrow down exactly what's causing it since I had to reinstall everything, but here is what is probably relevant:\r\n\r\nUbuntu 24.04.1\r\nZellij 0.40.1\r\nalacritty 0.13.2\r\nstarship 1.20.1 (f505324 master)\r\nzsh 5.9\r\nomz master~282 (b5583a32)",
